WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.700
A work item gets deleted by mistake.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.800
Jira Cloud has no recycle bin for a single work item.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.200
Once deleted, the item and its comments are gone.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.100
Atlassian's own restore request has been open since 2014.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.000
Restorable keeps a copy inside your own Jira site.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.000
Deleted items are listed: key, summary, space, date.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.300
One click to restore.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.200
Restored as KAN-16.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.100
Old comments come back quoted, with author and time.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.900
A comment records the old key.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.800
Attached files are listed, not restored.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.400
Runs on Atlassian. Copies stay in your Jira site.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.000
Restorable. Restore Deleted Work Items for Jira. By Clearwren. Now on the Atlassian Marketplace.
